{"id":"word:hebrew:H6256","type":"word","title":"עֵת","subtitle":"H6256 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"time , especially (adverb with preposition) now , when , etc.","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עֵת (H6256) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 296 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עֵת (ʻêth) means time , especially (adverb with preposition) now , when , etc. First listed occurrence: 1Chr 9 25."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עֵת","transliteration":"ʻêth","pronunciation":"ayth","strong":"H6256","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6256","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["בָּ/עֵ֣ת","עֵ֥ת","בָּ/עֵ֥ת","עֵ֣ת","לְ/עֵ֣ת"],"morphs":[["HRd/Ncbsa",79],["HR/Ncbsc",52],["HNcbsa",45],["HNcbsc",26],["HC/Ncbsa",14],["HR/Ncbsc/Sp3ms",12],["HC/Rd/Ncbsa",10],["HC/R/Ncbsc",8],["HR/Ncbsa",6],["HTd/Ncbsa",5]]},"definitions":{"short":"time , especially (adverb with preposition) now , when , etc.","usage":"after, (al-) ways, × certain, continually, evening, long, (due) season, so (long) as, (even-, evening-, noon-) tide, (meal-), what) time, when.","full":"H6256. eth עֵת 297 noun feminine Amos 5:13 and (seldom, mostly late) masculine Ezra 10:14 time (Late Hebrew id. ; Phoenician עת ; Assyrian inu, ittu , time ; Talmud עַנְתָּא ; clearly from a √ ענה , but doubtful whether I. ׳ע ); — absolute ׳ע Hosea 10:12 +, construct ׳ע Gen 24:12 + עֶתֿ Lev 15:25 + 5t.; suffix עִתּוֺ Hosea 2:11 +, etc.; plural, late, עִתִּים 1Chr 12:32 +, suffix עִתֶּיךָ , Isa 33:6 ; עִתּוֺת Psa 9:10 ; 10:1 , suffix עִתֹּתָ֑י 31:16 ; &#8212; ׳ע only twice P, once H; — 1 time of an event, etc.: a. usually (213 t.) with preposition: with בְּ (142 t.), especially ׳בָּע הַהִוא Gen 21:22 (E) in that time , 38:1 (J), Num 22:4 (E), Deut 1:9 14 t. Deuteronomy; ׳בָּע הַהִיא Josh 5:2 ; Amos 5:13 ; Dan 12:1 (twice in verse). + (69 t., not in P); ׳בָּע הַזּאֹת Est 4:14 , הָהֵם בָּעִתִּים 2Chr 15:5 ; Dan 11:14 ; בְּכָלעֵֿת at all times Exod 18:22 , 26 (E), Lev 16:2 (P) Psa 34:2 +; = continually Prov 8:30 , אֲשֶׁר בְּכָלעֵֿת Est 5:13 as long as I see Mordecai; with לְ (31 t.; compare ל 6 , p. 516 above), 2Sam 11:1 + at the time , but Ezek 12:27 for distant times , compare כָּזֹאת לְעֵת Est 4:14 , etc.; with כְּ (21 t.; compare כ 1a , p. 453 above), כָּע ׳מָחָר הַזּאֹת Josh 11:6 (JE) tomorrow about this time , usually ׳כָּע מָחָר (Kö Synt. 401 o ) Exod 9:18 (J), 1Sam 9:16 (compare Dr), 20:12 ; 1Kin 19:2 ; 20:6 ; 2Kin 7:1 , 18 ; 10:6 ; חַיָה כָּעֵת ; הָרִאשׁוֺן כָּעֵת Isaiah 8:23 at the former time ; כָּעֵת alone Num 23:23 (JE) at this time = now (probably, compare Di), Judg 13:23 ; 21:22 , etc.; with מִן (8 t.), הַהִא הָעֵת מִן Neh 13:21 , etc.; with עַד (12 t.), ׳עַדהָֿע הַהִיא 6:1 up to that time , עַדעֵֿת מֵעֵת Ezek 4:10-11 , etc. (5 t. Daniel); with אֶלעֵֿת מֵעֵת אלֿ, 1Chr 9:25 . b often construct defined by n.following: צָהֳרָ֑יִם בְּעֵת Jer 20:16 , (הָ)עֶרֶב לְעֵת 2Sam 11:12 ; Gen 8:11 ; 24:11 (both J), Isa 17:14 ; Zech 14:7 ; הָעָ֑רֶב עַדעֵֿת Josh 8:29 (JE), עֶרֶב מִנְחַת כְּעֵת Dan 9:21 , redundantly בְּיוֺם לְעֶתיֿוֺם 1Chr 12:22 , ׳ע (ה)קָצִיר Jer 50:16 ; 51:33 , ׳ע הַוָּמִיר Song 2:12 , ׳ע וִקְנָה 1Kin 11:4 ; 15:23 ; Psa 71:9 , ׳בְּע אַמְּךָ Jer 18:23 = ׳לְע מָּנְיךָ Psa 21:10 (of anger), בַּצָּרָה לְעִתּוֺת 9:10 ; 10:1 at time destitution (see בַּצָּרָה ), etc. c. followed by infinitive ׳לְע הַשֶּׁמֶשׁ בּוֺא Josh 10:27 (JE), 2Chr 18:34 , ׳בְּע קָרְאָם Jer 11:14 a (read בְּעֵת also v b, Gie), etc. d. followed by clause with finite verb (in poetry or late) Deut 32:35 ; Job 6:17 ; 2Chr 20:22 ; 24:11 ; 29:27 + (compare 2c ). 2. a. = usual time: ׳לְע צֵאת 2Sam 11:1 at time of kings' going forth = 1Chr 20:1 ; יַחֵם בְּעֵת Gen 31:10 ; לֶדֶת עֵת Job 39:1-2 ,. b. proper, suitable time: rain בְּעִתּוֺ Deut 11:14 Jer 5:24 +, compare Lev 26:4 (H), also Psa 1:3 ; 104:27 ; 145:15 ; Prov 15:23 ; Isa 60:22 ; Eccl 3:11 מִלְחָמָה עֵת 3:8 ; ׳ע שָׁלוֺם 3:8 ; followed by infinitive Hosea 10:12 , לָקַחַת הַעֵת 2Kin 5:26 is it a time to take money? Hag 1:4 , ׳י לְהִבָּנוֺת עֶתבֵּֿית 1:2 (v:a read בָּא עַתָּ Hi We Now and others); לַעֲשׂוֺת עֵת Psa 119:126 , compare Eccl 3:2-8 (26 t.); absolute עֵת כִּי Hosea 13:13 (Hi We and others; Gu Kau gives עַתָּ ; &gt; Now כָּעֵת ); absolute with negative Job 22:16 ; Eccl 7:17 ; hence (late) לָעִתִּים בִינָה יוֺדְעֵי 1Chr 12:32 , הָעִתִּים יִדְעֵי Est 1:13 i.e. astrologers, etc. c. appointed time , וגו תֵּת ׳בְּעֵת 1Sam 18:19 at the appointed time of giving , Ezek 7:7 , 12 ; Isa 13:22 , ׳ע מְּקֻדָּתָם Jer 8:12 ; 10:15 = 51:18 ; 46:21 ; 50:27 compare (with finite verb) 6:15 ; 49:8 ; 50:31 , ׳ע אַרְצוֺ 27:7 , ׳ע גּוֺיִם Ezek 30:3 , מְזֻמָּנִים לְעִתִּים Ezra 10:14 ; Neh 10:35 compareNehemiah 13:31; ׳עַדעֿ מוֺעֵד 2Sam 24:15 ; Psa 103:14 (|| מוֺעֵד ), etc.; compare וּמִשְׁמָּט עֵת Eccl 8:5-6 , (for time of judgment ), עִתּוֺ 9:12 ; especially קֵץ לְעֵת Dan 8:7 ; compare 11:35 , 40 ; 12:4 , 9 , ׳כְּע קֵץ עֲוֺן Ezek 21:30 ; Ezekiel 21:34; compare 35:5 ; הָעִתִּים לְקֵץ Dan 11:13 . d. as uncertain וָפֶגַע עֵת Eccl 9:11 . 3 = experiences, fortunes , plural עִתֶּיךָ אֱמוּנַת Isa 33:6 ; Psa 31:16 ; עָלָיו עָֽבְרוּ אֲשֶׁר הָעִתִּים 1Chr 29:30 4 occurrence, occasions (= מַּעַם ), עִתִּים רַבּוֺת Neh 9:28 great numbers of times (= very often).","rootNote":"from 5703 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 9 25","keyReferences":["1Chr 9 25","1Chr 9 25","1Chr 12 23","1Chr 12 33","1Chr 20 1","1Chr 20 1","1Chr 21 28","1Chr 21 29"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":296,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 9 25","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֵ/עֵ֥ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 25","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵ֖ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 23","book":"1Chr","ch